<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a 17th tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.40 pct vs	6.30 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.30 pct vs	7.19 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price   97.00   vs     97.70</p>
<p> Bids		 3.021 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a 15th tranche of the 10-year BTP on May 15.</p>
</text>
